o was  enraged by meteos statements and he said  that he does have friends like mikuren  tomo and monchan which are all memories  from shigeraki's childhood while he was  still tenkoshimura and before he became  shigaraki this confirms that there are  not only two personalities within  shigaraki's body ai the shigaraki we  know and all for one there is also a  third personality shigaraki's original  personality before he became a villain  tenko shimura this is a worrying  development for the all for one  personality because he wants the body to  become a perfectly melded combination of  him and shigaraki but little tenko  shimura is still in there and that could  put a wrench into all for one's ultimate  master plan the big three then employs  some masterful and highly dangerous  teamwork in order to try and strike a  serious blow against the overpowered  shigaraki after apparently eating an  entire restaurant's worth of food sun  eater turns into that guy from akira he  uses all the food that he ate to create  a massive organic plasma cannon from his  body and he launches a powerful blast  directly at chigaraki now i'm no  physicist so i don't know how eating a  bunch of different foods allowed the sun  eater to create a plasma cannon but i  guess maybe he launched what was  supposed to come out of him some other  way directly at shigaraki instead anyway  sun eater's plasma blast was able to  distract shigaraki long enough for meteo  to hit him right in the face with a  combination of his own strength and  nejida's energy and although this  delivers a tremendous blow to shigaraki  it just isn't enough to take him out  as a shocked and disappointed meteo  negere and sun eater look on shigeraki  tells them to stop being delusional did  they really think that their attacks  could bring down someone whose power  rivals the strength of all might in his  prime shikaraki thinks that the big  three are just not fully grasping how  powerful he truly is and so they are not  just wasting their own time but also his  time and it is at this point that  bakugou steps up to the plate yet again  despite being severely injured bakugou  tells genus to take care of everyone  because they still have a battle to win  as shigaraki approaches bakugou in the  style of a jojo villain bakugo is  suddenly able to anticipate shigaraki's  movements and dodge them with even more  speed than he had ever demonstrated  before it turns out that activating his  new move cluster bomb had several side  effects on bakugou's body that even he  didn't anticipate using cluster bomb  places a tremendous burden on the  nitroglycerin-filled sweat glands on  bakugo's palms and as he kept  accumulating more and more nitroglycerin  spheres in his palms there were just too  many for his palms to handle so these  spheres began dispersing throughout his  entire body in search of an outlet once  the spheres became dispersed throughout  his body they began to detonate allowing  bakugo to reach an unprecedented  explosive level of speed but as a result  his body feels like it is going to fall  apart and yet bakugou knows that this is  exactly what deku has been dealing with  his entire life he has been pushing  through the pain as his entire body felt  like he would fall apart in order to  improve and become stronger as he  continues to fight shigaraki bakugou  asks deku whether he will ever be able  to reach his level of strength and  determination as the fight continues  shigeraki actually finds himself losing  his cool he is even reminded of the  second one for all user who as many have  pointed out looks a lot like bakugou  this is interesting because it indicates  that shigaraki's anger and emotion are  coming from all for one or maybe the  quirk all for one which seems to  remember the second one for all user and  clearly the current fight against  bakugou is leading all for one to  remember the second user for whatever  reason it could be because the second  user looks a lot like bakugou and he had  also gathered allies to fight against  all for one's control just like bakugo  is doing now it could also be because  the second user risked everything and  sacrificed his own life to defeat all  for one just like bakugou seems to be  willing to do right now or there could  be some other connection here there is  of course a popular fan theory that the  second user of one for all is either  bakugou himself who traveled back in  time or it's someone directly related to  bakugou in some way like maybe one of  his ancestors i was always highly  skeptical of the bakugou is the second  user who traveled back in time theory  but with the crazy twist that we just  witnessed in this chapter i'm starting  to become a bit more open-minded i'll  talk more about this later but first  let's get back to the fight we then see  a sort of internal conversation going on  between bakugou and what looks like the  vestige of all might that currently  resides within one for all this could be  just a symbolic representation of all  might or this could be really part of  his vestige that remained within bakugou  due to the events of the second mha  movie either way bakugou says that he  had always meant to ask allmight to  autograph his almighty trading card that  he had bought together with deku when  they were kids due to the circumstances  in which they met bakugo never got the  chance to ask him to sign it but he  always wanted to the very next panel  that we see appears to show a part of  bakugo's body literally bursting apart  under the pressure that he had placed on  himself with all those nitroglycerin  explosions as bakugo's body falls to the  ground the big three and miracle attack  shigaraki at the same time genus rushes  to grab bakugo's lifeless body as it  bounces off the ground and as this  intense scene is happening in real time  we hear a weather report that bakugou's  parents just happen to be listening to  at the same time clouds have appeared in  the skies of the kanto chubu and kansai  regions even though the skies had been  clear just a moment ago and this has  also been accompanied by a sharp rise in  temperature it looks like it's about to  rain and the implication is that this  sudden and drastic weather change didn't  occur naturally we see a brief panel of  bakugou's parents with bakugo's mom  symbolically stating that boy hates rain  we then see the devastated faces of  genus monoma miruko and mirio as  shigaraki declares that the demon lord's  body is now fully realized and that  their story the story in which the  villain is the main character begins  here the final panel is absolutely  brutal and it shows bakugo's dead body  lying next to his almighty trading card  as genius implies that bakugou's heart  has stopped the text on the final page  says the end of dreams and man this is  probably the most heartbreaking and the  most brutal panel in all of mha oh and i  just realized as i'm recording this that  heartbreaking could be considered to be  a pun here but that was not my intention  it is too soon for puns too soon  honestly this is so rough and you know  i'm serious because i actually mentioned  bakugo's mom without even talking about  how hot she is and you guys who've been  watching this channel know that that is  very out of character for me this is  truly an insane and game-changing moment  in mha if this really turns out to be  the end of bakugo then this probably  will turn out to be the biggest moment  in mha period but i still say if because  i feel like bakugo is such an important  character to the story that it seems  crazy to think that horikoshi would kill  him off i mean sure characters like  midnight and sir nidai have been killed  off but they're not even in the same  league as bakugo when it comes to  importance to the story and overall  popularity in fact bakugo has  consistently been the single most  popular mha character according to both  the japanese and the us popularity polls  like he is literally the most popular  character and he has been for years he  is the undisputed fan favorite that is  one of the reasons why i think that  bakugou could still survive this somehow  because having him die like this without  achieving his dream of becoming an equal  to deku just seems so tragic however  horikoshi definitely made it seem like  he was dead it looked like his heart  actually burst open and yes he looks  extremely dead at the moment so reviving  him now without making it look like  cheap plot armor is going to be very  very difficult as upset as many fans are  certainly going to be if bakugou really  dies some fans are going to be equally  upset if he is somehow brought back to  life in a way that feels forced and  unrealistic so if bakugo somehow  survives how could that happen if his  heart has stopped how could he possibly  come back to life one option is that  eddie or someone who can use rewind for  whatever reason is able to use rewind on  bakugou before he clinically dies but  that is a long shot because why would  little arie appear on such a dangerous  battlefield all of a sudden but if we  are going with arie or someone else uses  her wind on bakugo then i wonder if ares  rewind can actually send people back in  time maybe that is what actually  happened to eddie's father he was sent  back in time but she doesn't realize it  and she thinks that she reminded him out  of existence so if arie is able to  accidentally rewind people back in time  maybe she really could do the same thing  to bakugou so bakugo's bodies are wound  back to life and back to a point where  he is not critically injured but he is  also accidentally sent back in time to  the era of the second one for all user  and he becomes the second one for all  user this would be a somewhat plausible  way of actually making that bakugo as  the second user theory happen but this  would be such an insane and out there  twist that i just don't know if  horikoshi would be willing to go that  far and this would also mean that while  bakugo is not technically dead he has  been sent back in time so he can never  see his parents or his friends ever  again another possibility for how bakugo  could survive that is not related to  rewind is related to nitroglycerin  itself just as i'm not a physicist i am  not a medical doctor so i can't confirm  any of this but people have been saying  on social media that nitroglycerin is  often used in heart medication and that  it can even be used to shock a heart  that has stopped back to life so maybe  bakugou's nitroglycerin will be able to  somehow shock his heart back to life  even if it has stopped  maybe but the one quick panel that we  got to see of bakugou's heart or at  least what looked like bakugo's heart  seemed to indicate that there was actual  physical damage that the heart had  suffered if that's the case then this  may not be a situation where his heart  can just be shocked back to life if  there is serious physical damage to the  organ then the damage has to be repaired  somehow before the heart can start  beating effectively again man what an  absolutely crazy chapter and you better  believe that bakugou has been trending  worldwide on twitter and other social  media nakstaku is once again being  hailed as the troll prophet of mha the  shippers are absolutely losing their  ship and the rest of us are wondering  where the story will go from here and  we're thinking about the absolutely  massive impact that this is sure to have  on deku and the other hero students i  need you guys to comment right now do  you think that bakugou is really dead or  can he somehow survive this  i'm not even kidding even if you've  never commented on one of my videos  before you need to comment on this one  personally i am extremely torn about  this whole situation on the one hand i  think bakugou is too important to die  but on the other i struggle to see how  he can be brought back to life at